SCP-XXXX is the designation provided for various humanoid lifeforms kept in Foundation captivity after their retrieval from Arlingpool, Nevada in 19XX. With the exception of SCP-XXXX-A, each possesses unique traits that are similar to Proto-Sarkic mutations, including the presence of SK-BIO organisms.
